o train AI models?\",{\"className\":\"group py-5\",\"open\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":[\"Are my video outputs used to train AI models?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\",\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\",\"children\":\"No. Albarza does not use your prompts, uploads, or generated videos to train AI models. All outputs are private and protected under strict security standards and the UAE PDPL.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"What AI video models are available?\",{\"className\":\"group py-5\",\"open\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":[\"What AI video models are available?\",\"$L2b\"]}],\"$L2c\"]}],\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\"]}]]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"relative overflow-hidden py-28 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"/media/hero.svg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"loading\":\"lazy\",\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-60\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-[40px]\",\"children\":\"Design with Albarza\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-white/80\",\"children\":\"Create with momentum. Bring your vision to life.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/signup\",\"className\":\"btn btn-gold\",\"children\":\"Sign Up\"}]}]]}]]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\",\"children\":\"+\"}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\",\"children\":\"The model picker includes Seedance, Veo, Kling, Wan, Sora, and others. Compare duration, resolution, audio support, and credit cost, then test the same brief in two models.\"}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"details\",\"How do I write a prompt for an AI video?\",{\"className\":\"group py-5\",\"open\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":[\"How do I write a prompt for an AI video?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\",\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\",\"children\":\"Describe the subject, action, setting, shot size, camera movement, and lighting. Example: “A red bicycle rolls along a coastal road at sunrise; steady side-tracking shot, soft golden light.” Review the clip and revise the detail that missed your intent.\"}]]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can I turn a photo into an AI video?\",{\"className\":\"group py-5\",\"open\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":[\"Can I turn a photo into an AI video?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\",\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\",\"children\":\"Yes. Add the photo as Start Image in the Video workspace, describe the subject's movement and camera direction, and choose a model. Review the preview and settings before generating.\"}]]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"details\",\"How are AI video generations charged?\",{\"className\":\"group py-5\",\"open\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":[\"How are AI video generations charged?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\",\"children\":\"+\"}]]}