$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\",\"children\":\"Describe the subject, action, setting, shot size, camera movement, and lighting. Example: “A red bicycle rolls along a coastal road at sunrise; steady side-tracking shot, soft golden light.” Review the clip and revise the detail that missed your intent.\"}]]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"details\",\"Can I turn a photo into an AI video?\",{\"className\":\"group py-5\",\"open\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":[\"Can I turn a photo into an AI video?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\",\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\",\"children\":\"Yes. Add the photo as Start Image in the Video workspace, describe the subject's movement and camera direction, and choose a model. Review the preview and settings before generating.\"}]]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"details\",\"How are AI video generations charged?\",{\"className\":\"group py-5\",\"open\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":[\"How are AI video generations charged?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\",\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\",\"children\":\"Albarza shows the credit cost before you generate. Select the model and settings, review the displayed amount, and confirm. Prices are in AED, inclusive of VAT.\"}]]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"details\",\"How do I choose between AI video models?\",{\"className\":\"group py-5\",\"open\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":[\"How do I choose between AI video models?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\",\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\",\"children\":\"Use the same short prompt, aspect ratio, and source image in two models. Compare motion quality, subject consistency, audio support, duration, resolution, and cost. Choose the output that fits the final channel.\"}]]}]\n33:null\n20:0\n15:\"$undefined\"\n12:\"$undefined\"\nc:\"$undefined\"\n5:\"$undefined\"\n1f:\"$undefined\"\nf:\"$undefined\"\n18:\"$undefined\"\n"}}